.github
.agents
.claude
.cursor
.arize-tmp-traces
__pycache__
*.pyc

.env
.env.braintrust
.env.example
.braintrust.json

scripts
evals/run_evals.py
evals/run_experiment.py
evals/benchmark_results.md

AGENTS.md
README.md
skills-lock.json
